].\n$$\n\nFinally, we have that ${x}_{1}=-6.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345167 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186344579 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345167 #edb/ref 1069 "q-76056" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345167 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345167 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the coordinates of the vector $x$ relative to the basis $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2},{b}_{3}\\},$ where\n\n$$\n{b}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,{b}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIf $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]$ then what is the value of ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345167 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b9b1c708-0429-5e44-9bc9-a554cb44ed9a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345167 #edb/ref 1074 "We need to find ${x}_{1}$,  ${x}_{2}$, and ${x}_{3}$ such that  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}{b}_{1}+{x}_{2}{b}_{2}+{x}_{3}{b}_{3} & =x \\\\ {x}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom this, we get the system with the augmented matrix $M$, which we reduce using Gaussian elimination: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M= & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 2 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-5){R}_{1} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 7 & -1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+6{R}_{2} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 25 & -25\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}=1 \\\\ {x}_{2}+3{x}_{3}=-4 \\\\ 25{x}_{3}=-25.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get ${x}_{3}=-1.$ Substituting this into the second   equation yields\n\n$$\n{x}_{2}+3(-1)=-4\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=-1.\n$$\n\n Finally,  by substituting ${x}_{2}=-1$ and ${x}_{3}=-1$ into the first equation we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+(-1)-(-1)=1\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=1+(-1)+(-1)=-1.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409787 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409787 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409787 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0470cd3b-2bcb-575e-9def-d43004406207" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409800 #edb/ref 1080 "5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409800 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409800 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a3e208c3-ba1a-51ec-b367-c2784fabe06c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409801 #edb/ref 1080 "x\\notin \\text{Span}{{b}_{1},{b}_{2},{b}_{3}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409801 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409801 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a5ba42a7-b00b-5980-9f89-48160c1eb49e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409806 #edb/ref 1080 "-5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409806 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409806 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d13c159c-f442-5933-a821-d94880c3ba32" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409809 #edb/ref 1080 "4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409809 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409809 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "eec553dd-6fd7-5208-9292-850213e9c19b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409812 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409787 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409812 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186409800 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186409812 #edb/ref 1075 #e